cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "car-rl: Learning to Follow and Overtake — Reinforcement Learning for Low-Speed Fleet Robots"
message: "If you use this code or dataset, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Zou"
    given-names: "Yang"
repository-code: "https://github.com/2572873335/car-rl"
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-20"
abstract: >-
  A digital-twin simulation and reinforcement-learning stack for low-speed
  fleet robots (AGVs) performing leader-following with a fixed gap and
  adaptive lane-change overtaking. Provides a layered controller
  (action prior + residual policy + vehicle dynamics constraints),
  domain randomization, a reproducible evaluation protocol with full
  termination-reason auditing, and a released demonstration dataset.
keywords:
  - reinforcement learning
  - PPO
  - behavior cloning
  - offline RL
  - robot following
  - overtaking
  - domain randomization
  - digital twin
